+## Thresholds (GA)
+Thresholds validate metric scores against user-defined minima:
+- CLI accepts repeatable `--threshold metric=min` options.
+- `generateReport` in frai-core accepts optional `thresholds` object: `{ exact_match: 0.9 }`.
+- Reports gain a top-level `passed` field and `thresholds` list with `{ metric, min, score, passed }` entries.
+- Exits: 0 if all pass or no thresholds set, 1 if any fail, 2 for malformed input (threshold format, value outside [0, 1], unknown metric id).
+- Works with custom metrics passed to `runEvaluations`.
+
 ## Follow-up Tasks
 1. Integrate real toxicity/bias models once provider abstraction is implemented (Phase 0 → Providers milestone).
 2. Extend datasets loader to support configurable schema mapping.
